# Delivery submission

POST /deliveries requires request_id and payload. request_id is stable for a
producer but is scoped to that producer's tenant; two tenants can use the same
value. Clients retry for up to 30 days when the response is lost. Delivery
records are retained for 90 days. The current handler returns the new row's id
and accepted_at with status 202. The API does not specify behavior when one
tenant reuses the same request_id with a changed payload.
